/farmland-atlas/wisconsin/lincoln-county"],["ARC or PLC in Lincoln County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/lincoln-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 50% of normal in October to November, and so far in 2026 June to July sits at 78%. Grid 30460 had its driest year in 1976 at 59%.</p>"}
